        "quote": "<h4><em>Who is VTrack best for? </em></h4><p><em>VTrack is the right choice for golfers who want a clean overhead setup with markerless tracking, deep ball and club data, slow-motion impact video, strong simulator software compatibility, and a one-time hardware investment that doesn't require ongoing monitor fees to remain useful.</em></p>",
